# The finite-product `TT*` operator

Section 3 of Anderson--Hughes--Roos--Seeger works on the literal finite
product `R^d × Z_j`, before taking the maximum over the sampled radii.  This
file records that operator in the finite-family language used elsewhere in
the development.  A field on `X × s` is converted to its active fibres, and
